Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:18:42 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] nss-wifi-drv: enable NSS Core 1 boot and C2C pairing

Enable the &nss1 DT node on Linksys MX4300 and extend nss-wifi-drv to support booting Core 1 independently of Core 0 (without touching EDMA, PPE, or Wi-Fi), with per-core buffer pool sizing, locked shared misc_reset updates, and automatic bidirectional C2C queue pairing plus /sys/kernel/debug/<core>/c2c diagnostics.
